#. Option for the 'Action if Accumulative Monthly Budget Exceeded on Cumulative
#. Expense' (Select) field in DocType 'Budget'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/budget/budget.json:125
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "چشم پوشی"

